flowchart TB
  User[User / API request] --> App[Application]
  App --> Prompt[promptlib render]
  App --> State[ContextState snapshot]
  Prompt --> Ctx[contextkit assemble]
  State --> Ctx
  Ctx --> Budget[token_kit budget / pack]
  Budget --> LLM[LLM provider HTTP]
  LLM --> Struct[Structured outputs Ch13+]
  Struct --> Tools[Tools / retrieval]
  Tools --> State
  LLM --> Log[Logs + assembly report + usage]
  Struct --> App
